t what's off.\u00a0</strong>As you make your way, something feels wrong about this place. You can't put your finger on it, but something is not right. Uncover the truth by thinking it through, talking with locals, and exploring the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588360/extras/8674520229f98128de8ed134081cc1d3.poster.avif?t=1756667985\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588360/extras/8674520229f98128de8ed134081cc1d3.webm?t=1756667985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588360/extras/8674520229f98128de8ed134081cc1d3.mp4?t=1756667985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a break.\u00a0</strong>Finally.. Take a rest for the night in the comfort of the trailer -- a place for you to recharge, recoup, and destress before your next big day of hiking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588360/extras/ad3f7bbcb826e9b1a8a99baea08ce92e.poster.avif?t=1756667985\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588360/extras/ad3f7bbcb826e9b1a8a99baea08ce92e.webm?t=1756667985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588360/extras/ad3f7bbcb826e9b1a8a99baea08ce92e.mp4?t=1756667985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make it out.</strong> All you really want to do is get THROUGH the night, so that you can continue on with your hike in the morning. You just have a few hours of the trail before you get to the parking lot where your coworker should be waiting for you.\u00a0</p>","developers":["keyboard"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588360/d3d01f70e1c4e6fae7aca2d06d3082ab7b5b0e9c/header.jpg?t=1756667985","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257168235,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168235/movie480.mp4?t=1752358341","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168235/movie_max.mp4?t=1752358341"},"name":"No Path Forward - Gameplay Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257168235/6a383b389c9261a35a138ec0ec463f7e7e66b2e1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752358341","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168235/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752358341","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168235/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752358341"}}],"name":"No Path Forward","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Win 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86/32-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 capability<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["keyboard"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo\nDrogas l\u00edcitas","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date